{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:31+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T06:39:31+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Mondi plc","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Paper & Paper Products","country":"United Kingdom","city":"Weybridge","website":"https://www.mondigroup.com","employees":22200,"summary":"Mondi plc, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture and sale of packaging and paper solutions in Africa, Western Europe, Emerging Europe, North America, South America, Asia, and Australia. The company operates through Corrugated Packaging, and Flexible Packaging segments. The Corrugated Packaging segment provides virgin and recycled containerboards for fresh fruit packaging and heavy and fragile goods transport packaging applications; and corrugated solutions, such as corrugated boxes and packaging products. The Flexible Packaging segment offers sack kraft paper, paper bags, specialty kraft paper, consumer flexibles, and functional paper and films. The Uncoated Fine Paper segment provides uncoated fine paper, including home, office, converting, and professional printing papers; and market pulp. The company was incorporated in 2007 and is based in Weybridge, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Mondi plc, avec ses filiales, se consacre à la fabrication et à la vente de solutions d'emballage et de papier en Afrique, en Europe occidentale, en Europe émergente, en Amérique du Nord, en Amérique du Sud, en Asie et en Australie. La société opère à travers les secteurs de l'emballage ondulé et de l'emballage flexible. Le segment des emballages ondulés fournit des cartons vierges et recyclés pour les emballages de fruits frais et les applications d'emballage de transport de marchandises lourdes et fragiles; et des solutions ondulées, telles que des boîtes en carton ondulé et des produits d'emballage.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":3290115328,"shares_outstanding":440797845,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":15.456273,"price_to_book":87.169205,"ev_to_ebitda":15.57,"ev_to_revenue":0.83,"dividend_yield":0.0166,"payout_ratio":1.9021001,"beta_yahoo":0.6},"targets":{"current_price":746.4,"mean":829.6559,"median":802.1418,"high":1069.2733,"low":624.0256,"n_analysts":14,"reco_mean":2.57143,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-07-30"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-08-20","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.0085,"institutions_pct":0.97152,"institutions_float_pct":0.97985,"institutions_n":270,"institutions":[{"name":"Boston Common Asset Management, LLC","pct":0.00059999997,"shares":248885,"value":185767770,"date":"2025-09-30","chg":-0.031400003}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0149,"shares":6555359,"value":4892920117,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.025899999},{"name":"HARTFORD MUTUAL FUNDS INC/CT-The Hartford International Value Fund","pct":0.012200001,"shares":5373723,"value":4010946978,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0626},{"name":"SPDR INDEX SHARES Fd.S-State Street SPDR S&P Global Natural Resources ","pct":0.011,"shares":4838832,"value":3611704322,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.17040001},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0097,"shares":4291168,"value":3202927899,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0194},{"name":"Datum One Series Trust-BRANDES INTERNATIONAL EQUITY FUND","pct":0.0095,"shares":4197106,"value":3132720020,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.28149998},{"name":"FINANCIAL INVESTORS TRUST-Seafarer Overseas Growth and Income Fund","pct":0.009,"shares":3964239,"value":2958908086,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.15020001},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0073,"shares":3209342,"value":2395452947,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0044},{"name":"SEI I